      "expected": "accept",
      "source": "#include <any>\nint main() {\n  std::any a(12);\n  int original = 21;\n  int& item = a.emplace<int>(original);\n  if (item != 21 || &item != std::any_cast<int>(&a))\n    return 1;\n  item = 32;\n  if (*std::any_cast<int>(&a) != 32)\n    return 2;\n  int& zero = a.emplace<int>();\n  return !a.has_value() || zero != 0 || &zero != std::any_cast<int>(&a);\n}\n",
      "source_sha256": "f01dce23b5c62d7670f14fdb121676dc80e92884ecd93db0c0057645bb5be0c8",
